### QUICK TEST FILE FOR VEHICLES API
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5093

### STEP 1: Login as Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### COPY THE accessToken FROM ABOVE AND PASTE IT BELOW
### Replace YOUR_TOKEN_HERE with the actual token

### STEP 2: Get My Vehicles (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ===================================
### FOR ADMIN/EMPLOYEE TO SEE ALL VEHICLES
### ===================================

### STEP 3: Login as Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### COPY THE accessToken FROM ABOVE

### STEP 4: Get ALL Vehicles (Admin/Employee)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Vehicles/all
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
